<![CDATA[<h1>09. 流程控制</h1><p>Author: Chiyuki(l12345p9876x0@gmail.com)</p>
        
          <p>程序的执行流程有三种基本结构：顺序结构、分支结构和循环结构。</p>
<h2 id="顺序结构">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e9%a1%ba%e5%ba%8f%e7%bb%93%e6%9e%84"></a>
顺序结构
</h2><p>按照程序正常的执行顺序，依次执行每条语句。</p>
<p><img src="/python/attachments/image-20251212213451077.png" alt=""></p>
<h2 id="分支结构">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%88%86%e6%94%af%e7%bb%93%e6%9e%84"></a>
分支结构
</h2><h3 id="单分支">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%8d%95%e5%88%86%e6%94%af"></a>
单分支
</h3><p><img src="/python/attachments/image-20251212222925929.png" alt=""></p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">条件表达式</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">语句块1</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>
<li>Python 把任何非 0 和非空的值当作 <code>true</code>，0 或 <code>None</code>、空容器当作 <code>false</code>，规则见 <a href="/post/06-booleans/">布尔</a> 中的真值测试。</li>
<li><code>if</code> 条件表达式后面必须加冒号 <code>:</code>。</li>
<li>条件成立执行语句块 1，否则不执行。语句块 1 必须缩进，可以有多行语句，用缩进区分同一范围，缩进取消后就不在分支范围内了，缩进规则见 <a href="/post/03-syntax-basics/">缩进</a>。</li>
</ul>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">num</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">5</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">num</span> <span class="o">%</span> <span class="mi">2</span> <span class="o">==</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="si">{</span><span class="n">num</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">是偶数&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="si">{</span><span class="n">num</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">是双数&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="si">{</span><span class="n">num</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">是可以被2整除的数&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>5</code> 是奇数，条件不成立，所以没有任何输出。</p>
<h3 id="双分支">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%8f%8c%e5%88%86%e6%94%af"></a>
双分支
</h3><p><img src="/python/attachments/image-20251212223559284.png" alt=""></p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">条件表达式</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">语句块1</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">else</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">语句块2</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>
<li><code>if</code> 条件表达式和 <code>else</code> 后面都必须加冒号。</li>
<li>条件成立执行语句块 1，否则执行语句块 2，两个语句块都必须缩进。</li>
</ul>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">num</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">5</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">num</span> <span class="o">%</span> <span class="mi">2</span> <span class="o">==</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="si">{</span><span class="n">num</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">是偶数&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="si">{</span><span class="n">num</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">是双数&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="si">{</span><span class="n">num</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">是可以被2整除的数&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">else</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="si">{</span><span class="n">num</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">是奇数&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="si">{</span><span class="n">num</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">是单数&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;</span><span class="si">{</span><span class="n">num</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">是不可以被2整除的数&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">5是奇数
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">5是单数
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">5是不可以被2整除的数
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>只需要二选一并返回一个值时，可以用条件表达式，见 <a href="/post/07-operators/">运算符</a> 中的条件表达式。</p>
<h3 id="多分支">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%86%e6%94%af"></a>
多分支
</h3><p><img src="/python/attachments/image-20251212223757647.png" alt=""></p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">条件1</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">语句块1</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">elif</span> <span class="n">条件2</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">语句块2</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">elif</span> <span class="n">条件3</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">语句块3</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">else</span><span class="p">:</span>    <span class="c1"># 可选</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">语句块n</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="mi">1</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>
<li><code>if</code>、<code>elif</code>、<code>else</code> 后面别忘了加冒号。</li>
<li>条件从上往下依次判断，上面的条件成立了，下面的条件就不再判断。</li>
</ul>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">from</span> <span class="nn">random</span> <span class="kn">import</span> <span class="n">randint</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 定义年龄并打印，:= 是海象运算符，先赋值再把值传给 print</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;此人年龄为&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">age</span> <span class="o">:=</span> <span class="n">randint</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">100</span><span class="p">))</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">age</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;这是个婴儿&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">elif</span> <span class="n">age</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="mi">4</span><span class="p">:</span>      <span class="c1"># 2 &lt;= 年龄 &lt; 4</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;这是个幼儿&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">elif</span> <span class="n">age</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="mi">13</span><span class="p">:</span>     <span class="c1"># 4 &lt;= 年龄 &lt; 13</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;这是个儿童&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">elif</span> <span class="n">age</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="mi">20</span><span class="p">:</span>     <span class="c1"># 13 &lt;= 年龄 &lt; 20</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;这是个青少年&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">elif</span> <span class="n">age</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="mi">65</span><span class="p">:</span>     <span class="c1"># 20 &lt;= 年龄 &lt; 65</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;这是个成年人&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">else</span><span class="p">:</span>              <span class="c1"># 65 &lt;= 年龄</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;这是个老人&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">此人年龄为 30
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">这是个成年人
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>输出的年龄是随机的。海象运算符见 <a href="/post/07-operators/">运算符</a>，随机数见 random。</p>
        
